  "subject": "dressing up for coffee with a high-school crush who calls after ten years of silence, and dancing out of the café when he opens a water-purifier catalogue",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien electro dance-pop diva song, a choreographed verse-chorus pop song with an electro-house drop. A four-on-the-floor kick; a distorted saw bass in a pumping sidechain; a bright detuned square-wave synth riff carrying the main hook; claps on two and four; white-noise risers into a short instrumental drop after each chorus. Punchy, loud club mix, kick and lead vocal forward, synth riff wide. Commanding, bright female pop belt with spoken and shouted ad-libs, every hook sung live by the one voice. 128 BPM, E minor. Furious at the old classmate's sales pitch, then dancing about it. No festival truck-stage remix, no trap hi-hats, no autotune, no rap verse, no slow ballad section, no plaintive weeping.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n十年無消無息 你敲電話來\n講欲約我 咖啡廳坐一下\n我去做頭毛 閣畫目眉\n穿我上媠 彼領紅洋裝\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n你笑甲 喙齒白鑠鑠\n對皮包 提出一本目錄\n\n[Chorus]\n你欲賣我濾水器 我就跳舞!\n音樂 開予上大聲!\n你講一句 我踏三步\n這杯咖啡 我家己付!\n\n[Verse]\n你講 一台三萬六 分十二期\n你講 揣兩个朋友 就會當趁錢\n你講 我是你 上相信的人\n十年來 這句上好笑\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n你笑甲 喙齒白鑠鑠\n閣提出 第二本目錄\n\n[Chorus]\n你欲賣我濾水器 我就跳舞!\n音樂 開予上大聲!\n你講一句 我踏三步\n規間咖啡廳 攏咧看!\n\n[Bridge]\n我徛起來 共你講\n十七歲 我寫予你的批\n你一張 嘛無回\n今仔日 我嘛無欲買\n\n[Chorus]\n你欲賣我濾水器 我就跳舞!\n懸踏鞋 行出咖啡廳!\n你講一句 我踏三步\n十年暗戀 洗予清氣!\n\n[Outro]\n電話 閣響第二遍\n我 攏無接",
